Claim 1 (Currently amended) A monitoring and early warning device for preventing falling during getting up of old people, comprising a bedstead mechanism (1), wherein [[the]]a top of the bedstead mechanism (1) is provided with a lifting auxiliary mechanism (2), and the top of the bedstead mechanism (1) is symmetrically provided with testing mechanisms (3) near both sides of the bedstead mechanism (1), [[the]]a back side of the bedstead mechanism (1) is provided with a headrest mechanism (5), and the top of the bedstead mechanism (1) is provided with a detection mechanism (4) near [[the]]a front side of the bedstead mechanism (1);

