the two testing mechanisms (3) both comprise side baffles (301); air bags (308) are installed on [[the ]]outer surfaces of [[the ]]opposite sides of the two side baffles (301), and a plurality of second pressure sensors (309) are embedded in [[the ]]outer surfaces of [[the ]]opposite sides of the two air bags (308) in an array mode, and optical fiber refractive index sensor groups (307) are symmetrically installed at [[the ]]positions, close to [[the]]an inner side, of [[the ]]tops of the two side baffles (301);

