the detection mechanism (4) comprises a [[long ]]rod (401), the [[long ]]rod (401) is fixedly installed at the top of the support frame (104) near the front side of the support frame (104), [[the]]a top of the [[long ]]rod (401) is fixedly connected to a mounting rod (402), a camera (405) is arranged at [[the]]a bottom of the mounting rod (402) near [[the]]a rear edge of the mounting rod (402); a motion sensor (404) is arranged at [[the]]a front side of the camera (405) at the bottom of the mounting rod (402); a time of flight (TOF) radar (403) is arranged at [[the]]a front side of the motion sensor (404) at the bottom of the mounting rod (402); and an acousto-optic alarm (406) is arranged at [[the]]a top of the mounting rod (402).



